    "name": "Delta Vector - Turn Based Racing",
    "steam_appid": 3437390,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delta Vector is a unique turn-based racing indie game that combines tactical decision-making with vector-based physics. Master the art of precision racing as you calculate your every move across challenging tracks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vector-Based Movement:</strong> Each turn presents you with 9 possible moves, carefully simulating real racing physics. Your previous speed and direction affect your next move, creating a strategic &quot;domino effect&quot; throughout the race.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Decision Making:</strong> Choose between accelerating, braking, or turning - or combine these moves for advanced maneuvers. Every decision matters as your momentum carries through each turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surface Physics:</strong> Race across different surfaces including asphalt and gravel, each affecting your car's handling and speed differently. Master the art of drifting on loose surfaces and maintaining control on tight corners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Feedback:</strong> Watch your car leave tire tracks, kick up gravel, and create smoke effects based on your driving style. The dynamic camera system follows the action, creating an immersive racing experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437390/extras/1242714d594043dbf4e0301f515ee5f1.poster.avif?t=1743043224\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437390/extras/1242714d594043dbf4e0301f515ee5f1.webm?t=1743043224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437390/extras/1242714d594043dbf4e0301f515ee5f1.mp4?t=1743043224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Trial:</strong> Perfect your racing line in single-player mode. Challenge yourself to complete laps with the fewest possible moves and compete for the best times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVP Racing:</strong> Challenge your friends in local  races. Take turns plotting your moves as you compete head-to-head for racing supremacy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Mode:</strong> Test your skills in a series of increasingly difficult scenarios. Unlock new cars and tracks as you progress through  challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437390/extras/f5366a41029eacf77f18456fb726cf4d.poster.avif?t=1743043224\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437390/extras/f5366a41029eacf77f18456fb726cf4d.webm?t=1743043224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437390/extras/f5366a41029eacf77f18456fb726cf4d.mp4?t=1743043224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Track Selection:</strong> Race across multiple meticulously designed tracks, each with unique layouts and challenges. From tight technical circuits to high-speed tracks, every course offers a different racing experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Variety:</strong> Choose from a garage of unique vehicles, each with different handling characteristics, speeds, and acceleration profiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Effects:</strong> Experience dynamic racing effects including tire smoke, exhaust effects, drift marks, and surface-specific particle systems that react to your driving style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible Controls:</strong> Easy to learn, hard to master - use simple mouse clicks or keyboard controls to select your moves, while the game handles the complex physics calculations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437390/extras/4149b23a2f581bc5e7834c1764e26d5d.poster.avif?t=1743043224\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437390/extras/4149b23a2f581bc5e7834c1764e26d5d.webm?t=1743043224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437390/extras/4149b23a2f581bc5e7834c1764e26d5d.mp4?t=1743043224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual racing fan or a hardcore strategist, Delta Vector offers a fresh take on the racing genre, combining the thoughtful planning of turn-based games with the excitement of motorsport physics!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delta Vector is a unique turn-based racing indie game that combines tactical decision-making with vector-based physics. Master the art of precision racing as you calculate your every move across challenging tracks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vector-Based Movement:</strong> Each turn presents you with 9 possible moves, carefully simulating real racing physics. Your previous speed and direction affect your next move, creating a strategic &quot;domino effect&quot; throughout the race.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Decision Making:</strong> Choose between accelerating, braking, or turning - or combine these moves for advanced maneuvers. Every decision matters as your momentum carries through each turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surface Physics:</strong> Race across different surfaces including asphalt and gravel, each affecting your car's handling and speed differently. Master the art of drifting on loose surfaces and maintaining control on tight corners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Feedback:</strong> Watch your car leave tire tracks, kick up gravel, and create smoke effects based on your driving style. The dynamic camera system follows the action, creating an immersive racing experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437390/extras/1242714d594043dbf4e0301f515ee5f1.poster.avif?t=1743043224\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437390/extras/1242714d594043dbf4e0301f515ee5f1.webm?t=1743043224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437390/extras/1242714d594043dbf4e0301f515ee5f1.mp4?t=1743043224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Trial:</strong> Perfect your racing line in single-player mode. Challenge yourself to complete laps with the fewest possible moves and compete for the best times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVP Racing:</strong> Challenge your friends in local  races. Take turns plotting your moves as you compete head-to-head for racing supremacy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Mode:</strong> Test your skills in a series of increasingly difficult scenarios. Unlock new cars and tracks as you progress through  challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437390/extras/f5366a41029eacf77f18456fb726cf4d.poster.avif?t=1743043224\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437390/extras/f5366a41029eacf77f18456fb726cf4d.webm?t=1743043224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437390/extras/f5366a41029eacf77f18456fb726cf4d.mp4?t=1743043224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Track Selection:</strong> Race across multiple meticulously designed tracks, each with unique layouts and challenges. From tight technical circuits to high-speed tracks, every course offers a different racing experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Variety:</strong> Choose from a garage of unique vehicles, each with different handling characteristics, speeds, and acceleration profiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Effects:</strong> Experience dynamic racing effects including tire smoke, exhaust effects, drift marks, and surface-specific particle systems that react to your driving style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible Controls:</strong> Easy to learn, hard to master - use simple mouse clicks or keyboard controls to select your moves, while the game handles the complex physics calculations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437390/extras/4149b23a2f581bc5e7834c1764e26d5d.poster.avif?t=1743043224\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437390/extras/4149b23a2f581bc5e7834c1764e26d5d.webm?t=1743043224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437390/extras/4149b23a2f581bc5e7834c1764e26d5d.mp4?t=1743043224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual racing fan or a hardcore strategist, Delta Vector offers a fresh take on the racing genre, combining the thoughtful planning of turn-based games with the excitement of motorsport physics!</p>",
